"활성화 = 디스플레이 꺼짐."

#: dragonpilot/settings/min-feat.dev.alert-mode.py:9
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Std.: Stock behaviour.<br>Warning: Only emits sound when there is a warning."
"<br>Off: Does not emit any sound at all."
